OL,3,GNEWSAOld US warship deliberately sunk
OL,4,Aduring training off Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decommissioned US warship has been
OL,7,Fsunk off Scotland's west coast during a
OL,8,Ftraining exercise.
OL,10,FUSS Klakring was hit by a missile and a
OL,11,Ftorpedo before sinking in the North
OL,12,FAtlantic about 170 miles (274km) off
OL,13,Fthe Outer Hebrides last Monday.
OL,15,FThe US Navy said the ship went a
OL,16,Fthrough "rigorous" cleaning process
OL,17,Ffirst, and personnel checked for the
OL,18,Fpresence of whales and dolphins before
OL,19,Fthe live-firing exercise started.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
