OL,3,GNEWSAOld US warship deliberately sunk
OL,4,Aduring training off Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther warships, including an aircraft
OL,7,Fcarrier in 2006, have been deliberately
OL,8,Fsunk at sea by the US as part of
OL,9,Ftraining and to create artificial reefs
OL,10,Ffor marine life.
